    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Disassembling Beaba Lutin night lamp",
            "text": "The lamp opens up at the base: there are two smaller tabs next to the button, the semi-transparent plasic can be pressed in a bit with a knife, put a bit of paper inbetween to prevent the clip from snapping back. Next go with a knife towards one of the large tabs on the side until one side snaps out. Repeat for other side.",
